\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 A Multi-Modal Phishing Detection Platform\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 URL Analysis, SMS/Email NLP Analysis, and Screenshot Phishing Detection\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Submitted in partial fulfillment of the academic project requirements\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Version 5.0\par
\page
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 Acknowledgement\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The CyberShield team sincerely thanks its project guide, faculty members, classmates,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 families, and friends for their support during the development of this academic project.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Their guidance helped shape the project from a URL-focused detector into a broader\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 phishing-awareness platform that considers the way people actually encounter\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 suspicious content: through links, messages, emails, and screenshots.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The team also acknowledges the cybersecurity and research communities whose\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 standards, threat reports, secure-development guidance, and open technical work make\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 responsible phishing analysis possible. The report is prepared using the\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 college-provided project-report index so that its study, design, data, results, and\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 references can be reviewed in a familiar academic structure.\par
\page
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 Abstract\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield is a web-based, multi-modal phishing detection platform designed to help\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 users assess suspicious URLs, SMS messages, email content, and screenshots before\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 they interact with them. The system combines cybersecurity intelligence,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 natural-language processing (NLP), and image processing (IP) to identify technical,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 linguistic, and visual indicators of phishing. Unlike a link-only checker, CyberShield\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 produces a unified risk assessment with evidence, confidence, limitations, and safe next\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 steps.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The proposed platform accepts a user submission, validates and normalizes it, applies a\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 modality-specific analysis pipeline, combines the resulting signals, and displays an\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 understandable result. It is designed around privacy-aware storage, role-based access,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 audit logging, safe file handling, configurable retention, and measurable verification.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 This report documents the problem, technology choices, system requirements,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 diagrams, data design, results, limitations, and future scope of CyberShield.\par
\page
