\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 2 Technology and Literature Review\b0\fs24\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 2.5 Web Application Technologies\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The platform can use a responsive web client, a secure API layer, asynchronous\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 analysis workers, a relational database, protected object storage, and monitoring.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Containerized services allow URL, NLP, and image workloads to scale independently.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 HTTPS, server-side secrets, structured logging, and role-based authorization are\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 baseline engineering requirements.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield treats this capability as a controlled pipeline rather than a single\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 prediction. Input is validated, normalized, and routed only to the services required for\par
