\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 3 System Requirements Study\b0\fs24\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 3.2 Hardware Requirements\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The academic deployment requires a modern client device with an updated browser and\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 stable internet connection. The server environment requires sufficient CPU and\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 memory for concurrent requests, protected storage for optional screenshots, and\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 optional GPU capacity only when a selected image model needs it. Resource limits\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 prevent large or deliberately malformed uploads from consuming analysis capacity.\par
