\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The system shall accept approved image formats within configured limits, verify the\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 file signature, decode pixels safely, perform OCR, identify relevant visual phishing\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 cues, and state OCR confidence. It shall flag login and OTP prompts, payment prompts,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 QR codes, obscured links, brand-like patterns, and suspicious urgency banners.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Image-derived and OCR-derived evidence are displayed separately.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield treats this capability as a controlled pipeline rather than a single\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 prediction. Input is validated, normalized, and routed only to the services required for\par
