\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The entity model connects a user to analysis requests and results, and connects each\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 result to one or more normalized indicators. Audit events remain separate from the\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 result so governance history cannot be overwritten.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The diagram is a logical representation intended to support implementation and testing.\par
