\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 5.3 Data Retention and Integrity\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Retention policy separates transient processing artifacts, user history, audit events, and\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 backups. A content hash supports integrity and duplicate analysis without requiring\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 unrestricted raw content. Deletes are recorded as audit actions; they remove or\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 de-identify eligible content while preserving only the governance information required\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 by policy.\par
