\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 5.4 Data Security Controls\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Database access uses service accounts with minimum permissions. Sensitive data is\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 encrypted at rest through approved platform controls, and data in transit uses TLS.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Queries use parameterized access patterns, exports require authorization, and logs omit\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 credentials, raw session tokens, and discovered secrets.\par
