\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield - Project Report\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 39\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 6 Result, Discussion and Conclusion\b0\fs24\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 6.3 Discussion\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield demonstrates why multi-modal analysis is valuable. A URL checker can\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 find infrastructure cues, but it may miss a persuasive message with no clickable link.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Text analysis can recognize social engineering, but it benefits from domain evidence.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Screenshot analysis can recover hidden context, but its certainty depends on OCR\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 quality. Combining these sources improves coverage while retaining an explanation of\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 each contribution.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield treats this capability as a controlled pipeline rather than a single\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 prediction. Input is validated, normalized, and routed only to the services required for\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 the selected modality. Each analyzer returns versioned indicators with severity,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 evidence source, and confidence. The scoring layer removes duplicate evidence, applies\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 a transparent policy, and records the limitations of unavailable services. This separation\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 makes the behavior easier to test, protects sensitive content, and allows a future model\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 or intelligence-feed change to be reviewed without changing the entire platform.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The implementation is validated with representative benign, ambiguous, and synthetic\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 phishing samples. Acceptance evidence includes correct input validation, a stable result\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 schema, explainable indicators, safe user guidance, and protected audit records. A result\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 is never described as guaranteed safe: where evidence is weak, stale, or unavailable, the\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 interface states that uncertainty and directs the user to verify through an independently\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 known official channel.\par
\page
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield - Project Report\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 40\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 6 Result, Discussion and Conclusion\b0\fs24\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 6.4 Limitations\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 No phishing detector can guarantee complete detection. Novel domains may not appear\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 in reputation feeds; legitimate messages can contain urgent language; attackers can use\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 high-quality copied graphics; and OCR can fail on low-resolution or mixed-language\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 images. The platform therefore communicates risk and evidence rather than issuing a\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 legal or forensic verdict. Human verification remains important for high-impact\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 decisions.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield treats this capability as a controlled pipeline rather than a single\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 prediction. Input is validated, normalized, and routed only to the services required for\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 the selected modality. Each analyzer returns versioned indicators with severity,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 evidence source, and confidence. The scoring layer removes duplicate evidence, applies\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 a transparent policy, and records the limitations of unavailable services. This separation\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 makes the behavior easier to test, protects sensitive content, and allows a future model\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 or intelligence-feed change to be reviewed without changing the entire platform.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The implementation is validated with representative benign, ambiguous, and synthetic\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 phishing samples. Acceptance evidence includes correct input validation, a stable result\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 schema, explainable indicators, safe user guidance, and protected audit records. A result\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 is never described as guaranteed safe: where evidence is weak, stale, or unavailable, the\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 interface states that uncertainty and directs the user to verify through an independently\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 known official channel.\par
\page
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield - Project Report\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 41\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 6 Result, Discussion and Conclusion\b0\fs24\par
\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 6.5 Conclusion\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield extends URL analysis into a practical phishing-awareness platform for\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 URLs, SMS/email text, and screenshots. Its contribution is not only the use of\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 cybersecurity, NLP, and image processing, but also the way those methods are\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 connected to safe input handling, transparent scoring, privacy controls, audit records,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 and user guidance. The documented baseline is suitable for iterative academic\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 implementation and evaluation.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 CyberShield treats this capability as a controlled pipeline rather than a single\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 prediction. Input is validated, normalized, and routed only to the services required for\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 the selected modality. Each analyzer returns versioned indicators with severity,\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 evidence source, and confidence. The scoring layer removes duplicate evidence, applies\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 a transparent policy, and records the limitations of unavailable services. This separation\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 makes the behavior easier to test, protects sensitive content, and allows a future model\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 or intelligence-feed change to be reviewed without changing the entire platform.\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 The implementation is validated with representative benign, ambiguous, and synthetic\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 phishing samples. Acceptance evidence includes correct input validation, a stable result\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 schema, explainable indicators, safe user guidance, and protected audit records. A result\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 is never described as guaranteed safe: where evidence is weak, stale, or unavailable, the\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 interface states that uncertainty and directs the user to verify through an independently\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 known official channel.\par
\page
