\pard\sb240\sa140\b\fs32 6.6 Future Scope\b0\fs24\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 Future work may add multilingual models, email-header analysis, QR-code destination\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 inspection, browser extension support, organization-specific brand profiles, analyst\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 case management, and SOC or ticketing integration. Every enhancement should be\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 assessed for new privacy, security, cost, and false-positive risks before it becomes part\par
\pard\qj\sa120\sl360\slmult1 of the product.\par
